# Tests for points & persistence

After changes here, run and extend:

```bash
pytest tests/unit/test_points.py tests/unit/test_serialize.py -q
```

- `points.py` → `as_point_source`, `FixedPoint`/`AtomPoint` resolve, hook-to-selection helper
- `serialization.py` → schema-1 `to_dict`/`from_dict` roundtrip, JSON-safe types, session document helpers
- `Displayable.py` → stable `id` across `rebuild`, not derived from `name` (`tests/unit/test_rebuild.py`)

Add cases when introducing new point types or persisted fields.
